1. Are you male or female, and if female, are you pre- or postmenopausal?
2. Have you had a DXA scan before? If yes, when and what were the results?
3. How often and at what doses have you taken prednisone? (one short taper each allergy season or more frequent/chronic?)
4. Are you taking aspirin, clopidogrel, warfarin, or a DOAC after your stroke?
5. Any GI symptoms (reflux, blood in stool, abdominal pain, anemia) or family history of colon cancer/polyps?
6. Do you want me to draft a concise message/email to Dr. Chen summarizing these questions or to a GI referral team (Boston GI)?

