- “Because of my stroke history, should I have a falls assessment or PT referral?”  
- “Do I need a GI referral to Boston GI for colonoscopy earlier than standard screening, or for evaluation of GI bleeding risk given any blood thinner/NSAID use or steroid exposure?”  
- “If treatment is recommended, what are the options (bisphosphonates, denosumab, etc.), and what are the pros/cons given my stroke and other medications?”

