1. “Can we order a DEXA (hip + spine) and get 25-OH vitamin D and TSH checked before deciding about treatment?”
2. “Please review my prednisone history — do I need bone protection because of steroid exposure?”
3. “Is my levothyroxine dose appropriate (please check TSH) given bone health concerns?”
4. “Given my stroke history, do you recommend starting medication for osteopenia or should we reassess fracture risk first?”
5. “Do I need a referral to gastroenterology (Boston GI)? I have/no GI symptoms and my family history is [state it].”
6. “If I need a bone medication but have GI issues, what alternatives would you recommend?”

